     pdf.js ?꾩씠?쒖쑝濡?履쇨컻???묒? ?덈? 媛꾧꺽???⑤뒗???щ???肄뷀띁?ㅼ뿉\\n    //     ?ㅼ옱?쒕떎 ??yokohama-p14 y??15.84????50x1000?띿씠 `650`쨌`x`쨌`1`쨌`000`\\n    //     ???꾩씠?쒖쑝濡??⑤떎. 洹몃윴??**遺숈뿬????媛꾧꺽(`1`??000`)怨?媛덈씪????    //     媛꾧꺽(`650`??x`, `x`??1`)???꾨? ?뺥솗??4.9770pt濡?媛숇떎.** ?대뼡 ?섑븳??    //     ?섏쓣 媛瑜댁? 紐삵븳??????000?띿쓣 ?대━??媛믪? ?똸1000?띾룄 ?④퍡 留뚮뱺??\\n    //     ?섑븳??吏?????덉뿀???좎씪???ㅻЪ???먮━?곸쑝濡?吏?????녿뒗 寃껋씠??\\n    //\\n    // 媛숈? ?꾩씠???덉쓽 湲?먮뒗 媛꾧꺽??**?뺥솗??0**?대떎(toTextItems媛\\n    // `x = ?먯젏 + characterWidth*index`濡??볤퀬 洹?characterWidth瑜?w濡??ｋ뒗??.\\n    // 洹몃옒????臾명꽦??媛瑜대뒗 寃껋? ?몄젣???꾩씠??**?ъ씠**?닿퀬, 臾명꽦??醫곹삍???뚯쓽\\n    // ?ㅽ뙣??蹂묓빀???꾨땲??遺꾨━ ??吏?대궡吏 ?딄퀬 嫄곗젅?섎뒗 履쎌씠??\\n    const threshold = previous ? Math.min(previous.h, item.h) * gapRatio : 0\\n\\n    if (!group || !previous || item.x - (previous.x + previous.w) > threshold) {\\n      groups.push([item])\\n    } else {\\n      group.push(item)\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return groups.map((group) => {\\n    const text = group.map((item) => item.str).join('')\\n    // ?멸렇癒쇳듃??諛붿슫??諛뺤뒪濡?x쨌endX쨌centerY瑜??곕떎(y??踰좎씠?ㅻ씪?몄씠??湲??    // ?섎굹??[y-h, y] 援ш컙). spread(Math.min(...)/Math.max(...))?????대떎 ??    // ?몄옄 ?섍? 湲由ы봽 ?섎? 洹몃?濡??곕씪媛 ?ㅽ깮 ?쒕룄?먯꽌 RangeError媛 ?쒕떎\\n    // (verticalRuns??flush()? 媛숈? ?댁쑀. x쨌endX????踰????댁쑀濡?怨좎퀜吏?    // centerY ?놁뿉 spread??梨꾨줈 ?⑥븘 ?덉뿀????#32 ?댁썡 吏??(b)).\\n    let x = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\n    let endX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\\n    let top = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\n    let bottom = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\\n    for (const item of group) {\\n      if (item.x < x) x = item.x\\n      if (item.x + item.w > endX) endX = item.x + item.w\\n      if (item.y - item.h < top) top = item.y - item.h\\n      if (item.y > bottom) bottom = item.y\\n    }\\n    return {\\n      text,\\n      compact: compact(text),\\n      items: group,\\n      x,\\n      endX,\\n      centerX: (x + endX) / 2,\\n      centerY: (top + bottom) / 2,\\n    }\\n  })\\n}\\n\\nexport function recoverRows(items: TextItem[], gapRatio?: number): TextRow[] {\\n  const rows: Array<Omit<TextRow, 'segments'>> = []\\n  const horizontalItems = items\\n    .filter(\\n      (item) =>\\n        item.str.trim().length > 0 &&\\n        (item.rot === undefined || Math.abs(item.rot) < ROTATION_TOLERANCE_DEG),\\n    )\\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y || left.x - right.x)\\n\\n  for (const item of horizontalItems) {\\n    let closest: Omit<TextRow, 'segments'> | undefined\\n    let closestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\\n\\n    for (const row of rows) {\\n      const distance = Math.abs(row.y - item.y)\\n      const tolerance = Math.max(1, Math.min(row.height, item.h) * 0.3)\\n      if (distance <= tolerance && distance < closestDistance) {\\n        closest = row\\n        closestDistance = distance\\n      }\\n    }\\n\\n    if (closest) {\\n      closest.items.push(item)\\n      closest.y =\\n        closest.items.reduce((total, rowItem) => total + rowItem.y, 0) /\\n        closest.items.length\\n      closest.height = Math.max(closest.height, item.h)\\n    } else {\\n      rows.push({ y: item.y, height: item.h, items: [item] })\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  return rows\\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y)\\n    .map((row) => ({ ...row, segments: makeSegments(row.items, gapRatio) }))\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * ?몃줈?곌린 臾몄옄?댁쓣 蹂듭썝?쒕떎. `recoverRows`???뚯쟾 ?꾩씠?쒖쓣 踰꾨┛????媛濡???蹂듭썝?? * ?욎씠硫??됱씠 ?ㅼ뿼?섍린 ?뚮Ц?대떎. 洹?寃곌낵 ?ㅼ?移??놁뿉 ?몃줈濡??곹엺 移섏닔媛 ?듭㎏濡?蹂댁씠吏\\n * ?딅뒗?? ??씊 ?쇰꺼 ?됱씠 ?녿뒗 ?쒖뿉?쒕뒗 洹멸쾬??d???좎씪??洹쇨굅??(ojkk ?긱꺁?밤깉).\\n *\\n * rot=-90留?諛쏅뒗?? ?쎄린 ?쒖꽌媛 y ?대┝李⑥닚??寃껋? ?ㅻЪ?먯꽌 ?뺤씤??媛믪씠怨? ?ㅻⅨ\\n * ?뚯쟾媛곸? ?쒖꽌媛 ?ㅼ쭛?????덈떎 ????00?띿씠 ??07?띿씠 ?섎㈃ 議곗슜???由?媛믪씠 ?쒕떎.\\n * ?뚯쟾 ?띿뒪?몄뿉??w??媛濡???씠 ?꾨땲??湲??吏꾪뻾?됱씠誘濡??몃줈 媛꾧꺽?쇰줈 ?대떎.\\n *\\n * `originGapRatio`???몄젒 ?먯젙 諛곗닔?댁?留?**makeSegments??`gapRatio`? ?щ뒗 ??곸씠\\n * ?ㅻⅤ??*: makeSegments??吏꾪뻾?됱쓣 類 ?щ갚(`x - (previous.x + w)`)??怨깊븯怨? ?ш린?쒕뒗\\n * ?먯젏 ?ъ씠 嫄곕━(`previous.y - y`)??怨깊븳?? 洹몃옒??媛숈? ?섎? ?ｌ뼱??媛숈? ?살씠 ?꾨땲怨? * ???좏겙 ?대? 媛꾧꺽??媛濡쒖뿉?쒕뒗 嫄곗쓽 0?몃뜲 ?몃줈?먯꽌???뺥솗??1w?????몃줈 諛곗닔??